{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iPhone 或 iPad 螢幕出現特點、觸控失靈或殘影問題？在前往維修中心前，使用 ScreenDoctor PRO 進行全面檢測。這款應用提供多種專業級診斷模式，幫助用戶快速識別顯示缺陷與觸控異常，適合購買二手設備前的驗機檢查，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多重模式精準檢測</h2>\n<p>此應用程式內建純色測試以偵測死點，梯度測試檢查色彩漸變均勻度，以及棋盤格高對比圖案定位微小瑕疵。針對 OLED 螢幕，其燒屏測試可有效發現狀態欄殘影；觸控繪畫功能則驗證全域反應靈敏度。此外，應用還包含螢幕真偽指南，協助用戶判斷是否為原廠零件，介面簡潔無廣告且支援離線操作，讓檢測過程專注高效。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-162-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-163-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-164-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-165-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-166-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ScreenDoctor PRO</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T22:18:27.567011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}